The '''Australian DM2 Showdown 1''' tournament was organised for a select group of Division 2 and 3 Quakers - who had returned to QW after many years, and for some of the regular players who didn't normally favour [[dm2]] as their preferred duel map. With a variety of gaming backgrounds, it comprised CPMA players, Quake Live players, and one of the representatives in the [[GetQuad! Nations Cup|GetQuad Nations Cup 4on4]] tournament that was run in 2020. 

The round robin stage was played over three sessions between April 16th and April 18th 2021, and the finals were played the following friday night on the 23rd April 2021. 

All matches were streamed by ''Cooked eSports'' streamer Australia {{Player|dracs|flag=au}}, with co-commentators {{Player|Andeh|flag=se}}, {{Player|KF|flag=au}}, {{Player|yeti|flag=au}} & {{Player|dirtbox|flag=au}}.

===Format===
* '''Round-Robin Group'''
** All matches are {{abbr|BO3|Best of Three}} on [[dm2]]
** Top 4 advance to Finals
* '''Single-Elimination Finals''' 
** Semis and Bronze game are {{abbr|BO3|Best of Three}}, Grand Final is {{abbr|BO5|Best of Five}}

